.SH "نام (NAME)"
pkgctl-repo-web \- Open the packaging repository\*(Aqs website
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
pkgctl repo web [OPTIONS] [PKGBASE.\|.\|.]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
Open the packaging repository\(cqs website via xdg\-open. If called with
no arguments, open the package cloned in the current working directory.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
\fB\-\-print\fP
.RS 4
Print the url instead of opening it with xdg\-open
.RE
.sp
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fP
.RS 4
Show a help text
.RE
.SH "HOMEPAGE"
.sp
\fI\c
.URL "https://gitlab.archlinux.org/archlinux/devtools" "" "\fP"
.sp
